dracht wacht. Diezelfde avond komt er werkelijk een geheimzinnige brief. Wat begon als een verzinsel voor zijn leerlingen, krijgt daarmee gevolgen buiten het klaslokaal. Frans probeert uit te zoeken wie achter de boodschap zit en wat er van hem verwacht wordt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bibliografische bron; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/260809/de-zevensprong.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","review_batch":"nl007-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/260809/de-zevensprong.html","sha256":"3635c8829b29b98058f07c4217a6aa94f2c6844018868a2e9e42a76a5d35dc80","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T20:41:14.203Z","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789025875688 Nieuwe editie verschijningsdatum 18/06/2018 NUR 283 Fictie 10-12 jaar 282 Fictie 7-9 jaar imprint Leopold uitgever WPG Kindermedia taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Tonke Dragt"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/260809/de-zevensprong.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","fact":"Work-bound content reviewed; original factual Dutch summary, not source quotation or title-derived content."}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789045125084","key":{"id":978200114},"before":null,"after":{"id":978200114,"title":"De tunnel","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789045125084","work_id":978100015,"cover_id":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"Querido","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":null}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789045125084","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789045125084"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789045125084","work_id":978100015,"bound_author_id":939300674,"bound_title":"De tunnel","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789045125084","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000512819_De_tunnel_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1317032/de-tunnel.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","review_batch":"nl007-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1317032/de-tunnel.html","sha256":"702c405bcb83645e7a3e7f47f98d9ff0a39631f191bcfc72128d2e80997d2a69","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T20:44:02.537Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789045125084 verschijningsdatum 11/05/2021 NUR 284 Fictie 13-15 jaar imprint Querido uitgever Singel Uitgeverijen taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Anna Woltz"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000512819_De_tunnel_0_0.jpg","sha256":"f55b0ddbc6c3864332a409e6fb6fb2450d93af31703e90fcbbe4f4d3c7865894","bytes":519473,"checkedAt":"2026-11-01T21:22:39.145Z","fact":"Exact edition block and human visual review; same observed provider image stem for medium variant."},{"url":"https://annawoltz.nl/over-mij/","fact":"Anna Woltz De tunnel2021; A.B.Yehoshua same-title result rejected.","checkedAt":"2026-11-01"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:1142","key":{"work_id":978100015,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":978100015,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":939300674,"text":"Tijdens de bombardementen op Londen in 1940 schuilen mensen iedere nacht in de ondergrondse. Daar ontmoeten Ella, Quinn, Jay en Sebastian elkaar. Ieder draagt een eigen geschiedenis met zich mee, terwijl de oorlog hen in dezelfde beperkte ruimte samenbrengt. De veertienjarige Ella vertelt hoe deze ontmoeting haar blik verandert. Tussen perrons en sporen ontstaan relaties die buiten de tunnel misschien nooit mogelijk waren geweest.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bibliografische bron; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1317032/de-tunnel.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","review_batch":"nl007-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1317032/de-tunnel.html","sha256":"702c405bcb83645e7a3e7f47f98d9ff0a39631f191bcfc72128d2e80997d2a69","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T20:44:02.537Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789045125084 verschijningsdatum 11/05/2021 NUR 284 Fictie 13-15 jaar imprint Querido uitgever Singel Uitgeverijen taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Anna Woltz"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1317032/de-tunnel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","fact":"Work-bound content reviewed; original factual Dutch summary, not source quotation or title-derived content."}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024598786","key":{"id":978200115},"before":null,"after":{"id":978200115,"title":"De kinderen van het Achtste Woud","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789024598786","work_id":978100016,"cover_id":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh Sijthoff","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":null}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024598786","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024598786"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024598786","work_id":978100016,"bound_author_id":978300004,"bound_title":"De kinderen van het Achtste Woud","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789024598786","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000535859_De_kinderen_van_het_Achtste_Woud_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1190332/de-kinderen-van-het-achtste-woud.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","review_batch":"nl007-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1190332/de-kinderen-van-het-achtste-woud.html","sha256":"6607095f417e7022b7c897ceed39a054e7e0a10033a4b99391ff7b6d46c628c4","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T20:41:18.642Z","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789024598786 verschijningsdatum 18/10/2022 NUR 283 Fictie 10-12 jaar imprint Luitingh Sijthoff uitgever Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Els Pelgrom"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000535859_De_kinderen_van_het_Achtste_Woud_0_0.jpg","sha256":"2d47b8c5b55e1026c274633452a39459a6334c63ae8bdc3fc052b2e3f3277b96","bytes":52210,"checkedAt":"2026-11-01T21:22:40.483Z","fact":"Exact edition block and human visual review; same observed provider image stem for medium variant."}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:1143","key":{"work_id":978100016,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":978100016,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":978300004,"text":"In de winter van 1944 moeten de twaalfjarige Noortje en haar vader hun huis verlaten. Op een boerderij op de Veluwe vinden ze een heel ander dagelijks leven dan ze gewend zijn. Hongerige mensen kloppen aan en ook Duitse soldaten worden er ondergebracht. Wanneer Noortje ontdekt dat in het nabije bos Joodse onderduikers verborgen zitten, krijgt de schijnbare geborgenheid van de boerderij een gevaarlijke keerzijde.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bibliografische bron; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1190332/de-kinderen-van-het-achtste-woud.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","review_batch":"nl007-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1190332/de-kinderen-van-het-achtste-woud.html","sha256":"6607095f417e7022b7c897ceed39a054e7e0a10033a4b99391ff7b6d46c628c4","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T20:41:18.642Z","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789024598786 verschijningsdatum 18/10/2022 NUR 283 Fictie 10-12 jaar imprint Luitingh Sijthoff uitgever Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Els Pelgrom"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1190332/de-kinderen-van-het-achtste-woud.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z","fact":"Work-bound content reviewed; original factual Dutch summary, not source quotation or title-derived content."}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789046706466","key":{"id":978200116},"